portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/lolita/Hero203-portrait-20220525164742.webp\",\"splashUrl\":null,\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Lolita/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Radiant Fan\",\"tier\":\"Exceptional\",\"rawTier\":\"Exceptional\",\"tag\":null,\"tagSlug\":null,\"price\":\"Limited-time Event\",\"portraitFile\":null,\"portraitUrl\":null,\"splashUrl\":null,\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Lolita/Cosmetics\"}],\"lore\":{\"backstory\":\"Lolita is a Steel Elf, a rare hybrid of elven grace and Eruditio engineering, who serves as the guardian of the city's most vulnerable districts. She wields the Noumenon Energy Core, a massive hammer and shield combination that can project an energy barrier capable of absorbing all incoming ranged projectiles. Despite her small stature, Lolita's courage is enormous. She was the first to charge into the breach when Abyss forces penetrated Eruditio's outer walls, her shield absorbing an entire volley of dark magic. Her infectious determination and unbreakable defense have made her a beloved protector among Eruditio's citizens, and she takes fierce pride in being the shield that stands between her city and annihilation.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"johnson\",\"heroName\":\"Johnson\",\"relationship\":\"Eruditio mechanical guardian and patrol partner\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"fanny\",\"heroName\":\"Fanny\",\"relationship\":\"Sky trooper who provides aerial support while she holds the line\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"grock\",\"heroName\":\"Grock\",\"relationship\":\"Stone titan whose raw power overwhelms her energy shield\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"franco\",\"heroName\":\"Franco\",\"relationship\":\"Northern hook-wielder who drags her away from her defensive position\"}]},\"loreUrlName\":\"Lolita\",\"statsHistory\":[{\"date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"winRate\":54.05,\"pickRate\":0.09,\"banRate\":0.32},{\"date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"winRate\":53.88,\"pickRate\":0.09,\"banRate\":0.3